          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "3.3.1 Properties of Ionic Compounds"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.274,
            0.387,
            0.899,
            0.42
          ],
          "content": "**To learn about the properties of ionic compounds, let us perform the following Activity:**"
